    [
      "Jay",
      "[confident] Keys and Neon, launch night edition. [pause] It's out, Rosa. Everywhere."
    ],
    [
      "Rosa",
      "[smug] I noticed. The marina was empty. Even the pelicans were inside, playing."
    ],
    [
      "Jay",
      "[confident] In Miami, one fan at midnight called it cinematic. Another one took the day off."
    ],
    [
      "Rosa",
      "[confident] Reasonable. I took the week."
    ],
    [
      "Jay",
      "[confident] The Heat played as Vice City last night, and won, one thirty-seven to one thirty. The jerseys sold out in about ninety minutes."
    ],
    [
      "Rosa",
      "[smug] Ninety minutes. My bait shop has been open forty years. Still waiting for a line."
    ],
    [
      "Jay",
      "[confident] Philadelphia did a twelve-hour lockout. Midnight to noon, nobody leaves."
    ],
    [
      "Rosa",
      "[confident] That's not a party. [pause] That's a hostage situation with snacks."
    ],
    [
      "Jay",
      "[confident] And reviewers found the details. Wear socks with flip-flops, and the game calls it a crime."
    ],
    [
      "Rosa",
      "[smug] Finally, a game that understands Florida."
    ],
    [
      "Jay",
      "[excited] Team Keys or Team Neon? Tell us in the comments. [pause] This was Keys and Neon, by Full Clear."
    ]
  ],
